# suite TXMDVAT VAT audit trail listin
ok 1 - the detail listing runs and returns 00 or 04
ok 2 - the detail listing names its spool file
ok 3 - one listed line per VAT transaction of the period
ok 4 - the MTD audit trail runs and returns 00 or 04
ok 5 - the MTD audit trail names its spool file
ok 6 - all nine VAT return boxes are listed
ok 7 - box 01 of the listing equals fin.VatReturnBox
ok 8 - box 02 of the listing equals fin.VatReturnBox
ok 9 - box 03 of the listing equals fin.VatReturnBox
ok 10 - box 04 of the listing equals fin.VatReturnBox
ok 11 - box 05 of the listing equals fin.VatReturnBox
ok 12 - box 06 of the listing equals fin.VatReturnBox
ok 13 - box 07 of the listing equals fin.VatReturnBox
ok 14 - box 08 of the listing equals fin.VatReturnBox
ok 15 - box 09 of the listing equals fin.VatReturnBox
ok 16 - an unknown VAT period is refused with 08
1..16
# TXMDVAT VAT audit trail listin passed 00016 failed 00000
# exit 0
